; THESIS: Faithful source equipment shops, with real crafting and hero purchases.
; OWN-WORLD: Original fantasy inked sprites, teal panels, purple banners, cream type.
; STORY: Browse recipes, craft, manage stock, summon, trade each equipment part.
; FIRST VIEWPORT: Chained building header above a four-column grid and four bottom tabs.
; FORM: User-pinned source screenshots; extension of shipped weapon shop, no concept roll.
; FINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the finish review, the verdict, DESIGN.md, and every shipping raster carrying its provenance
